/**
 * @title Path operations
 * @difficulty beginner
 * @tags cli
 * @run -R <url>
 * @resource {https://jsr.io/@std/path/doc} Doc: @std/path
 * @resource {https://docs.deno.com/api/deno/~/Deno.cwd} Deno: Deno.cwd
 * @group File System
 *
 * Many applications need to manipulate file paths in one way or another.
